      pickB: ["Cloud services & SaaS products", "Enterprise IT & DevOps services", "Root domain for customer instances (app.acme.cloud)", "Renewal-budget sensitive (.host renews steepest)", "Platform brands wanting a registry run by a cloud provider"],
