      metaDescription:
        ".berlin is Berlin's official city suffix — sharpest for local positioning at {{price:berlin:first:usd}} to register and {{price:berlin:renew:usd}}/yr to renew; .city is the generic city word for any town, {{price:city:first:usd}} to register and {{price:city:renew:usd}}/yr to renew. Compare semantics, pricing and fit, then hunt names available on both.",
