      metaDescription:
        ".jp is Japan's most trusted market entrance at {{price:jp:first:usd}} to register and {{price:jp:renew:usd}}/yr to renew with a local-address requirement; .cn is affordable and ICP-filing friendly with real-name verification. Compare markets, eligibility and cost structure, then hunt available names.",
