        ".no is Norway's country domain at {{price:no:first:usd}} to register and {{price:no:renew:usd}}/yr to renew, requiring a Norwegian-registered organization; .dk is Denmark's at {{price:dk:first:usd}} to register and {{price:dk:renew:usd}}/yr to renew, open to anyone with registry ID validation. Compare market signals, eligibility and pricing, then hunt available names.",
